          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzakugcina umkhosi wesinkwa esingelamvubelo, udle isinkwa esingelamvubelo insuku eziyisikhombisa ngesikhathi esimisiweyo senyanga kaAbibi, njengokukulaya kwami; ngoba waphuma eGibithe ngaleyonyanga; kakuzukuza muntu phambi kwami engaphethe lutho.",
          "type": "text",
