              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kawuyikunikela igazi lomhlatshelo wami kanye lesinkwa esilemvubelo. Amafutha omkhosi wami angalali kuze kuse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.18",
