          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikhethelo lezithelo zokuqala zamasimu akho uzakuliletha endlini yeNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho. Ungapheki izinyane ngochago lukanina.",
          "type": "text",
